<p>This page serves as a repository for ready to use M2DA's and Scripts to use in conjunction with <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/PRCSCR" title="PRCSCR">PRCSCR</a> M2DA's when adding custom content to the game. 
</p><p>References:
</p>
<ul><li>See Main Article: <i><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/PRCSCR" title="PRCSCR">PRCSCR</a></i></li>
<li>See <i><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/PRCSCR.xls" title="PRCSCR.xls">PRCSCR.xls</a></i> for details about that M2DA, or <i><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/2DA" title="2DA">2DA</a></i> for an explanation of 2DA's as a whole</li>
<li>To create a Script, right click in the Resourcepalette and select "New/Script" , or see <i><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Designer%20Resources" title="Designer Resources">Designer Resources</a></i> for such Resources as a whole.</li></ul>
<p><br />
<b>Contents:</b>
</p>
